  "description": "Elevate your designs with Ragnar Gothic, a powerful and expressive Old English font that bridges the gap between medieval tradition and contemporary bold aesthetics. Established in 2026, this typeface is meticulously crafted for creators who need a “Gothic” look that remains clean, readable, and undeniably impactful. Ragnar Gothic is the ideal choice for branding and identity projects that require a touch of history and strength. Create memorable identities for streetwear brands, breweries, or heavy metal aesthetic projects.\n Whether you are designing for a modern brand or a vintage-inspired project, Ragnar Gothic provides the weight and character needed to leave a lasting impression.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Elevate your designs with Ragnar Gothic, a powerful and expressive Old English font that bridges the gap between medieval tradition and contemporary bold aesthetics. Established in 2026, this typeface is meticulously crafted for creators who need a “Gothic” look that remains clean, readable, and undeniably impactful. Ragnar Gothic is the ideal choice for branding and identity projects that require a touch of history and strength. Create memorable identities for streetwear brands, breweries, or heavy metal aesthetic projects.</p>\n<p> Whether you are designing for a modern brand or a vintage-inspired project, Ragnar Gothic provides the weight and character needed to leave a lasting impression.</p>",
